OL,3,GNEWSANHS staff get 'landmark' payout
OL,4,Aover gas exposure
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS maternity staff who were exposed to
OL,7,Fexcessive levels of nitrous oxide have
OL,8,Freceived "landmark" payouts totalling
OL,9,F#735,000, a union said.
OL,11,FBasildon Hospital in Essex settled
OL,12,Fclaims from 121 staff, including 85
OL,13,Fmidwives, who took legal action after
OL,14,Freporting fatigue, anxiety, headaches
OL,15,Fand "brain fog" after the gas levels
OL,16,Fbreached safety limits.
OL,18,FThe Mid and South Essex NHS Foundation
OL,19,FTrust said it had apologised to staff.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
